# Round-5 R5-B1 fix : ensure LICENSE + NOTICE are bundled into the
# sdist tarball (and, via setuptools' standard rule, into the wheel
# `.dist-info/`). Without this, PyPI / pip-installed users only see
# the SPDX identifier from the pyproject `license = { text = ... }`
# metadata — Apache-2.0 § 4(a) requires the actual License text be
# distributed alongside.
include LICENSE
include NOTICE
include README.md
recursive-include efe_tool *.py *.pyi *.proto
